    <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="kicker">Frequently asked questions</span><h2 class="sec-title">Your questions, my answers.</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">My brand is known for its inclusive shade range — do I even need SEO? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Precisely because of that. Your reputation creates the demand; SEO decides who banks it. If a retailer resells your shades and dominates your queries, you're funding their growth with your positioning.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">Is SEO for beauty for Black skin really specific? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>The mechanics are standard, the terrain isn't: queries by skin tone and undertone, a strong "match" stake, competition from retailers with powerful domains, and an advice need that AI captures.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">How do I make every shade findable on Google? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>It comes down to how product pages and variants are structured, match content, and internal linking. The Diagnostic identifies which shades are slipping away and why.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">How do I get recommended by an AI for a specific shade? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>That's GEO: a brand clearly tied to its shade-matching expertise, citable content, structured presence. The Diagnostic checks whether you're cited today.</p></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q">How long before results? <span class="pm"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Reclaiming your branded SERP is faster than winning "foundation for Black skin". The Diagnostic puts the quick wins first.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="links-more reveal">
      <h2>Go further</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/en/seo-african-heritage-brands/">SEO strategy for African & Black-owned brands</a></li>
